{title: 683 - Jesus, Stand Among Us}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Sentences and Responses}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
Jesus, stand among us
In Thy risen power;
Let this time of worship
Be a hallowed hour.

Verse 2:
Breathe the Holy Spirit
Into every heart;
Bid the fears and sorrows
From each soul depart.

Verse 3:
Thus with quickened footsteps
We pursue our way,
Watching for the dawning
Of eternal day.
